.DATA
VT@Object: DW lbl_toString@Object
.CODE
lbl_toString@Object: 
LOADFP; apilar valor de FP
LOADSP; apilar valor de SP
STOREFP; almacenar FP en el tope de la pila
LOAD 3
LOADREF 1; acceso a atributo (className)
SPRINT
lbl_end_toString@Object: NOP
STOREFP; restaurar FP
